<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was slow late Thurssday. Slaughter steers and heifers closed steady.</p>
<p>Inquiry was good, demand was light. Sales confirmed on 4,000 slaughter steers and 1,900 slaughter heifers early. Week to date 87,500 head confirmed including 24,500 head or about 28 percent or previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Steers - select and choice 2-3 1150-1375 lbs 64.00; mostly select, few choice 1225 lbs 63.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select and choice 2-3 1020-1200 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>confirmed: 5900    last week: 54600   last year: 41200</p>
<p>Week-to-date 87500  last week: 82000  last year: 57000</p>
</text>
